---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL
  : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;

const tools = [
  'SEO',
  'Keyword research',
  'Content strategy',
  'Search Console',
  'Google Analytics',
  'WordPress',
  'Astro',
  'HTML & CSS',
  'Tailwind',
  'Git & GitHub',
  'SEMrush',
  'Ahrefs',
];
---

<Layout
  title="Experience"
  description="Naman Patel’s experience across SEO, content, web products, WordPress, and the tools and workflows he uses to turn ideas into finished work."
>
  <section class="experience-hero shell shell--wide" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
    <div class="experience-hero__copy">
      <span class="experience-kicker">Experience</span>
      <h1 id="experience-title">I learned most of this by doing it.</h1>
      <p class="experience-lede">
        I started with SEO and content, then kept following the work into websites, WordPress, product thinking, and building my own tools.
      </p>
      <p>
        I’m largely self-taught. The pattern has usually been the same: find something worth understanding, work on it long enough to get useful at it, then keep refining the parts that matter.
      </p>
      <a class="arrow-link" href={`${base}projects/`}>See what I’ve built <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>

    <div class="experience-hero__art" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="field-notes">
        <div class="field-notes__top"><span>FIELD NOTES</span><i></i></div>
        <strong>Learn it.<br />Use it.<br />Make it better.</strong>
        <div class="field-notes__lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <small>still figuring things out →</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section shell shell--wide" aria-labelledby="areas-title">
    <div class="experience-heading">
      <span>01 / THE WORK</span>
      <div>
        <h2 id="areas-title">Where I’ve spent the most time</h2>
        <p>Not a list of badges. Just the areas I keep coming back to and have real hands-on experience with.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="experience-cards">
      <article class="experience-card experience-card--seo">
        <div class="experience-card__art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="seo-board">
            <div class="seo-board__query">how do people find this?</div>
            <div class="seo-board__results">
              <span><b>01</b><i></i><i></i></span>
              <span><b>02</b><i></i><i></i></span>
              <span><b>03</b><i></i><i></i></span>
            </div>
            <div class="seo-board__chart"><i></i></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__copy">
          <span>SEO / CONTENT</span>
          <h3>Understanding search, then making something worth finding.</h3>
          <p>
            SEO is where most of my experience began. I’ve worked through keyword research, search intent, content planning, on-page improvements, WordPress publishing, Search Console data, and the less glamorous job of figuring out why a page is not doing what it should.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Keyword and topic research</li>
            <li>Content structure and on-page SEO</li>
            <li>Search Console and analytics</li>
            <li>WordPress publishing and optimisation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="experience-card experience-card--web">
        <div class="experience-card__art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="web-window">
            <div class="web-window__bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>localhost</span></div>
            <div class="web-window__canvas">
              <div class="web-window__hero"></div>
              <div class="web-window__grid"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            </div>
            <b>looks useful. ship it.</b>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__copy">
          <span>PRODUCT / WEB</span>
          <h3>Taking an idea far enough that someone can actually use it.</h3>
          <p>
            Over time I moved from only growing websites to building them too. I like the part where a rough idea becomes a structure, an interface, and eventually a real thing that has to work outside my head.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Astro sites and web tools</li>
            <li>HTML, CSS and responsive interfaces</li>
            <li>WordPress and theme work</li>
            <li>Product thinking, iteration and shipping</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="experience-card experience-card--workflow">
        <div class="experience-card__art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="workflow-desk">
            <div class="workflow-note workflow-note--one"><small>RESEARCH</small><strong>Know what matters.</strong></div>
            <div class="workflow-note workflow-note--two"><small>MAKE</small><strong>Get to a real version.</strong></div>
            <div class="workflow-note workflow-note--three"><small>REFINE</small><strong>Fix what feels off.</strong></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__copy">
          <span>TOOLS / WORKFLOW</span>
          <h3>I care more about using tools well than collecting tool names.</h3>
          <p>
            I’m comfortable moving between research, writing, publishing, code, GitHub, analytics, and newer development tools when they help. The useful part is being able to choose a path, get unstuck, and keep the work moving.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Research and synthesis</li>
            <li>Writing, editing and publishing</li>
            <li>Git, GitHub and deployment workflows</li>
            <li>Fast iteration with modern development tools</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section experience-proof shell shell--wide" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
    <div class="experience-heading">
      <span>02 / PROOF</span>
      <div>
        <h2 id="proof-title">A few things that taught me the most</h2>
        <p>The useful bits of my résumé are the projects where the numbers, users, or outcome forced me to learn properly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="proof-grid">
      <article class="proof-card proof-card--traffic">
        <span class="proof-card__index">A</span>
        <strong>Up to 1M</strong>
        <h3>monthly visitors</h3>
        <p>I grew one of my own content projects to roughly a million visitors per month at its peak.</p>
        <div class="traffic-spark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
      </article>

      <article class="proof-card proof-card--acquired">
        <span class="proof-card__index">B</span>
        <strong>Acquired</strong>
        <h3>an entertainment project</h3>
        <p>A US-focused entertainment site I worked on was later acquired by WealthOfGeeks Media.</p>
        <div class="acquired-stamp" aria-hidden="true">project<br />→ media</div>
      </article>

      <article class="proof-card proof-card--now">
        <span class="proof-card__index">C</span>
        <strong>Still building</strong>
        <h3>the next set of skills</h3>
        <p>SmallMB, Astro SEO Audit, Get Random Letter, Calm WP and this site are the current classroom.</p>
        <a href={`${base}projects/`}>Current projects →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section shell shell--wide" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
    <div class="experience-heading">
      <span>03 / TOOLBOX</span>
      <div>
        <h2 id="tools-title">Things I’m comfortable working with</h2>
        <p>This changes over time. That is kind of the point.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tool-shelf" aria-label="Tools and skills">
      {tools.map((tool, index) => (
        <span style={`--tilt: ${index % 3 === 0 ? '-1deg' : index % 3 === 1 ? '1deg' : '0deg'}`}>{tool}</span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="experience-end shell shell--wide">
    <p>
      The common thread is pretty simple: I like understanding how something works, making a version of it, and staying with it long enough to make the version better.
    </p>
    <div>
      <a class="arrow-link" href={`${base}projects/`}>Projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="arrow-link" href={`${base}about/`}>More about me <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .experience-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(18rem, 0.75fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7.5rem);
  }

  .experience-kicker,
  .experience-heading > span,
  .experience-card__copy > span {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .experience-hero h1 {
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--reading);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.94;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .experience-hero__copy > p {
    max-width: 58ch;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .experience-hero__copy .experience-lede {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .experience-hero__copy .arrow-link {
    margin-top: 1.35rem;
  }

  .experience-hero__art {
    position: relative;
    min-height: clamp(22rem, 37vw, 31rem);
    background: #8da8e8;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .field-notes {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 10% 10% 8%;
    padding: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    border: 1px solid #1d2025;
    color: #20211f;
    background: #f3eedc;
    box-shadow: 1rem 1rem 0 #ff7658;
    transform: rotate(2.5deg);
  }

  .field-notes__top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #aba79b;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .field-notes__top i {
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #d95c45;
  }

  .field-notes strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 18%;
    font-family: var(--reading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.7vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .field-notes__lines {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .field-notes__lines i {
    display: block;
    width: 88%;
    height: 1px;
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    background: #aaa598;
  }

  .field-notes__lines i:nth-child(2) { width: 72%; }
  .field-notes__lines i:nth-child(3) { width: 81%; }

  .field-notes small {
    position: absolute;
    right: 8%;
    bottom: 6%;
    color: #a34b39;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
  }

  .experience-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(7rem, 0.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
  }

  .experience-heading h2 {
    max-width: 16ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.052em;
  }

  .experience-heading p {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .experience-cards {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .experience-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(18rem, 0.92fr) minmax(0, 1.08fr);
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .experience-card:nth-child(even) .experience-card__art {
    order: 2;
  }

  .experience-card__art {
    position: relative;
    min-height: clamp(20rem, 38vw, 31rem);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .experience-card--seo .experience-card__art { background: #f2d74f; }
  .experience-card--web .experience-card__art { background: #22463c; }
  .experience-card--workflow .experience-card__art { background: #8da8e8; }

  .experience-card__copy h3 {
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--reading);
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .experience-card__copy p {
    max-width: 58ch;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .experience-card__copy ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .experience-card__copy li::before {
    content: '→';
    margin-right: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .seo-board {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 10%;
    color: #20211f;
  }

  .seo-board__query {
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #20211f;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    background: #f8f1d8;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: clamp(0.55rem, 1vw, 0.72rem);
  }

  .seo-board__results {
    width: 84%;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 0 auto;
    border: 1px solid #20211f;
    background: #f8f1d8;
    box-shadow: -0.8rem 0.8rem 0 #ff7658;
    transform: rotate(1deg);
  }

  .seo-board__results span {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3rem 1fr;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #c3bda9;
  }

  .seo-board__results span:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }

  .seo-board__results b {
    grid-row: span 2;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
  }

  .seo-board__results i {
    display: block;
    width: 88%;
    height: 1px;
    background: #989589;
  }

  .seo-board__results i + i { width: 62%; }

  .seo-board__chart {
    position: absolute;
    right: 2%;
    bottom: 1%;
    width: 52%;
    height: 26%;
    border-left: 1px solid #20211f;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #20211f;
  }

  .seo-board__chart i {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 20% 5% 8% 5%;
    border-top: 3px solid #17695a;
    transform: skewY(-18deg) rotate(-4deg);
  }

  .web-window {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 10%;
    padding: 0 1rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid #163027;
    color: #dff5eb;
    background: #102d24;
    box-shadow: 1rem 1rem 0 #ff7658;
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
  }

  .web-window__bar {
    height: 2.4rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #315247;
  }

  .web-window__bar i {
    width: 0.42rem;
    height: 0.42rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #6f9287;
  }

  .web-window__bar span {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: #83a99d;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
  }

  .web-window__canvas {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid #46685d;
  }

  .web-window__hero {
    height: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 7rem);
    background: #d9e8d9;
  }

  .web-window__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
  }

  .web-window__grid i {
    height: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    background: #6fa695;
  }

  .web-window b {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    color: #ff9d89;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
  }

  .workflow-desk {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 9%;
    color: #1b1c20;
  }

  .workflow-note {
    position: absolute;
    width: 78%;
    min-height: 34%;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.5rem);
    border: 1px solid #1b1c20;
    background: #f3eedc;
  }

  .workflow-note--one { top: 0; left: 0; transform: rotate(-4deg); }
  .workflow-note--two { top: 30%; right: 0; z-index: 2; background: #ff7c5f; transform: rotate(3deg); }
  .workflow-note--three { bottom: 0; left: 4%; z-index: 3; transform: rotate(-1deg); }

  .workflow-note small {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: clamp(0.48rem, 1vw, 0.62rem);
  }

  .workflow-note strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--reading);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .experience-proof {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .proof-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .proof-card {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 21rem;
    padding: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #24231f;
    color: #22211d;
  }

  .proof-card--traffic { background: #f2d74f; }
  .proof-card--acquired { background: #9fdcd8; }
  .proof-card--now { background: #f3eedc; }

  .proof-card__index {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
  }

  .proof-card > strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 15%;
    font-family: var(--reading);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .proof-card h3 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .proof-card p {
    max-width: 32ch;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .proof-card a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .traffic-spark {
    position: absolute;
    right: 8%;
    bottom: 8%;
    width: 44%;
    height: 22%;
    border-left: 1px solid #22211d;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #22211d;
  }

  .traffic-spark i {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 28% 4% 10%;
    border-top: 4px solid #d4523c;
    transform: skewY(-20deg) rotate(-5deg);
  }

  .acquired-stamp {
    position: absolute;
    right: 9%;
    bottom: 8%;
    width: 6.2rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid #22211d;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ff7658;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transform: rotate(9deg);
  }

  .tool-shelf {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .tool-shelf span {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    background: var(--surface);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    transform: rotate(var(--tilt));
  }

  .experience-end {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
  }

  .experience-end > p {
    max-width: 44ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--reading);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .experience-end > div {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .experience-hero,
    .experience-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .experience-card:nth-child(even) .experience-card__art {
      order: 0;
    }

    .experience-hero__art,
    .experience-card__art {
      min-height: 24rem;
    }

    .proof-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .proof-card {
      min-height: 18rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .experience-heading {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    .experience-hero__art,
    .experience-card__art {
      min-height: 20rem;
    }

    .experience-end {
      align-items: start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .experience-end > div {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  }
</style>
